fter  successfully hijacking an imperial  gozanti cruisership  a model first spotted in the phantom  menace mando departs to continue his  mission of delivering the child to its  people  but not before asking his fellow  mandalorian where he can find the jedi  she claimed to know  grade 4 for his aid bokeh tan tells him  to travel to the city of kaladin to the  forest planet of corvus  a new location for the star wars  universe so who is this jedi on corvus  another animated favorite ahsoka tano  the debut of anakin skywalker's former  padawan and live action  has been a long time coming with  speculation over rosario dawson's  casting as ahsoka running rampant for  months  and the circumstances surrounding her  imminent arrival couldn't be more  satisfying for die-hard star wars fans  you should have seen him in person  anakin skywalker  he was my master having initially  squared off as enemies  bogutan and ahsoka allied during the  siege of mandalore  as detailed on clone wars seventh season  once the jedi disbanded and order 66  went into full effect  leading ahsoka to go into hiding the  status of their coalition grew murky  but it seemed that they retained some  method of contact throughout the  galactic civil war  and in the midst of the empire's  collapse also much like bogota  ahsoka's adventures continued through  rebels where she took up the codename  fulcrum and became a secret rebel  operative  episode two of the second season of the  disney plus hits the mandalorian  was as eccentric as anything in the star  wars universe  and that includes plenty of tasty hidden  easter eggs for fans to spot  after returning from the successful  crate dragon hunt the mandalorian  returns to mos  eisley in chapter 10 the passenger to  meet with pele motto he reports back and  lets her know that the supposed  mandalorian frequenting mos  pelgo was just a man in mandalorian  armor but she reassures him that she can  put him in contact with someone who can  lead him to his